<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <body style="font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: #111">
    <p>Hello,</p>
    <p>
      We received the application for <strong>{{organizationName}}</strong> on
      <strong>{{appName}}</strong>.
    </p>
    <p>Tracking code: <strong>{{applicationCode}}</strong></p>
    <p><a href="{{trackUrl}}" style="color: #0b57d0">Follow the review</a></p>
    <p style="font-size: 0.875rem; color: #444">
      A reviewer will look at your paperwork and may ask for additional documents.
      Keep this link — you will need it to update or withdraw the application.<br />
      {{trackUrl}}
    </p>
  </body>
</html>
